sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CO as Coordinator
    participant R as Replica
    participant BF as Bloom filters
    participant PI as Partition indexes
    participant SST as SSTables
    CO->>R: Point read
    R->>BF: Check each SSTable
    BF-->>R: 7 maybe, 5 absent (illustrative)
    loop Maybe files only
      R->>PI: Locate partition
      PI->>SST: Read candidate cells
      SST-->>R: Cells and timestamps
    end
    R->>R: Merge by timestamp (newest wins)
    R-->>CO: One row
